# Frozen Chem wiring

`quizData.js` is generated by `scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/build_quiz.py`. Runners own tracking.

Change `scripts/quiz/microscopic-world-i/questions.json` (and `CHAPTER_META` if needed), then rebuild. Do not patch this file by hand.

Do not edit `postMessage`, `uniplus:quizAnswer`, `quizId`, `questionId`, or network calls. If the teacher needs that, stop and name the technical owner.
